Linked List: Slow and Fast Pointer Technique
Aaj hum Slow and Fast Pointer ko diagram se samjhenge — kaise kaam karta hai, slow ek step aur fast do steps kyun chalta hai, aur kin questions mein use kar sakte hain.
1. Slow aur Fast Pointer kya hain?
Linked List mein har node ke paas data aur next node ka address/reference hota hai.
- Slow pointer: ek iteration mein 1 node aage badhta hai.
- Fast pointer: ek iteration mein 2 nodes aage badhta hai.
Dono same starting node se shuru ho sakte hain, lekin unki speed alag hoti hai.
